Dataset Da​n​n(2)D\_{ann}^{(2)}: For obtaining unseen sentences to evaluate sentence classification models, we used audit reports from 2015, removed the sentences that did not have any verb, or had length less than 10 words or greater than 50 words and from the remaining sentences, randomly selected 500 sentences making sure they are sufficiently different from each other to avoid near-duplicates. We designed detailed annotation guidelines using which we manually labelled each sentence as either ADV\_REMARK or NA. A total of 82 sentences (16.4%) were labeled as ADV\_REMARK and the remaining 418 as NA.

