Training of T5 classifier: We now explain how we trained the T5 classifier to label a given sentence as ADV\_REMARK or NA. We used sentence datasets D0D\_{0}, D1D\_{1} and Da​n​n(1)D\_{ann}^{(1)} to train the T5 model. The training process involved two steps:

